ng the country's economic bubble era. The game follows two protagonists: Kazuma Kiryu in Tokyo's Kamurocho district and Goro Majima in Osaka's Sotenbori district. Players alternate between their stories as they navigate the criminal underworld, engaging in street fights, managing businesses, and participating in various side activities.\n\nThe gameplay combines beat 'em up combat with open-world exploration, offering numerous mini-games and side quests.\n\nThe Digital Deluxe Edition of Yakuza 0 comes with bonus content, including avatars, wallpapers, and a digital manga.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/yakuza-0-digital-deluxe-edition", "videos": [{"id": 29545, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "JCzACWVB9gQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JCzACWVB9gQ", "title": "Yakuza 0 Official Trailer - E3 2016", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JCzACWVB9gQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}